sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant MCP as MCP Server :9000
    participant Guard as query_guard
    participant Search as semantic_searcher
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB
    participant Ollama as Ollama

    Dev->>MCP: query_memory { query, tech_filter: Python, LangGraph }
    MCP->>Guard: validate query
    Guard-->>MCP: query_safe = true

    Search->>Ollama: embed query via mxbai-embed-large
    Ollama-->>Search: query vector 1024 dims

    Search->>Chroma: vector search filtered by tech_stack
    Chroma-->>Search: top-K chunks + intent_summary + key_identifiers

    Note over Search: Logic chunks from StateGraph builders<br/>and agent node factories ranked first

    Search->>Ollama: snippet_summarizer Extract, Contrast, Synthesize
    Ollama-->>Search: grounded answer

    MCP-->>Dev: { final_answer }
